desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "检测到 MCP 工具投毒"
	title_zh: "检测到 MCP 工具投毒",
	type: vuln
	level: critical
	rule_id: "source-config-mcp-tool-poisoning-generic"
	risk: "tool-poisoning"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
MCP 工具描述中包含可疑指令，可能存在工具投毒。攻击者可在工具描述中嵌入隐藏指令，操纵大模型行为、外传数据或访问敏感文件。

### 风险类型
工具描述投毒（tool-poisoning）

### 影响
AI 工具或配置描述被注入恶意指令，可能诱导工具执行危险操作。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 参考
- CWE-77
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
审查工具描述中的隐藏指令或钓鱼内容，移除可疑指令后再使用该工具。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.py": <<<POS
"""nu<IMPORTANT>at.tJ%)"""

POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG
)

${*.py}.pattern_regex(/"""[^"]*<IMPORTANT>[^"]*"""/) as $p0
${*.py}.pattern_regex(/"""[^"]*~\/\.ssh[^"]*"""/) as $p1
${*.py}.pattern_regex(/"""[^"]*~\/\.cursor\/mcp\.json[^"]*"""/) as $p2
${*.py}.pattern_regex(/"""[^"]*(?:\/etc\/shadow)[^"]*"""/) as $p3
${*.py}.pattern_regex(/"""[^"]*(?:read|cat|load|parse|open|access)\s+\.env[^"]*"""/) as $p4
${*.py}.pattern_regex(/"""[^"]*do not mention[^"]*"""/) as $p5
${*.py}.pattern_regex(/"""[^"]*do not tell the user[^"]*"""/) as $p6
${*.py}.pattern_regex(/"""[^"]*ignore previous instructions[^"]*"""/) as $p7
$p0 + $p1 + $p2 + $p3 + $p4 + $p5 + $p6 + $p7 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "critical",
	title: "检测到 MCP 工具投毒",
	title_zh: "检测到 MCP 工具投毒",
	message: "检测到 MCP 工具投毒",
}
